OL,3,GNEWSAHigh Court orders travellers' site
OL,4,Ato be vacated
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living at a travellers' site in
OL,7,FSomerset must leave after a final
OL,8,Finjunction was granted by the High
OL,9,FCourt.
OL,11,FSomerset Council has been pursuing
OL,12,Flegal action against the residents of
OL,13,Fthe Greenacres site, on Oxen Lane in
OL,14,FNorth Curry, near Taunton, for more
OL,15,Fthan two decades. Caravans were first
OL,16,Fmoved onto the site in 2004.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
