OL,3,GNEWSAHigh Court orders travellers' site
OL,4,Ato be vacated
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter unauthorised work began there in
OL,7,FOctober 2024, a temporary injunction
OL,8,Fwas granted in July 2025 to stop anyone
OL,9,Felse moving in, and the council later
OL,10,Frefused planning permission for 16
OL,11,Fpitches for caravans and static homes
OL,12,Fon the site.
OL,14,FCouncillor Mike Rigby said it had been
OL,15,Fa "long-running and complex case."
